    {
        "content": "<p><span aria-label=\"speech balloon\" class=\"emoji emoji-1f4ac\" role=\"img\" title=\"speech balloon\">:speech_balloon:</span> cfallin created <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/pull/14254#discussion_r3906930063\">PR review comment</a>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Ah, the smul cases below use <code>sxt{b,h}</code>; this comment is just attached to a umul case (and note the equivalent comment below uses the signed versions).</p>\n</blockquote>",
